{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31596","headline":"广州陪凉公从叔越台讌集 · 李羣玉","name":"广州陪凉公从叔越台讌集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一迳松梢踏石梯，步穷身在白云西。\n日衔赤浪金车没，天拂沧波翠幕低。\n高鸟散飞惊大斾，长风万里卷秋鼙。\n玉钩挂海笙歌合，珠履三千半似泥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31596.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31596","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}